<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>We entered Megasawa City at 21:30.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In about 15 more minutes we'd reach Nanamiso, where <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> lived.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\後部座席夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In the rear-view mirror I could see <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, breathing softly in her sleep.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When we put her back in the car at <STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE>'s family home, <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> fell asleep right away.<PG>
The precognition <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> had gained since that accident.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It must be a power given to her by the one who tried to protect <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> to the very last moment, <STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, to help us avoid the tragedy about to happen, <STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE> had warned us through <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's what I believe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Surely <STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro</STYLE> will move <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s heart too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "2000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車エンジン切る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\七海荘.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, are you ready for this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I'm fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took the luggage, and <STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> carried <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> in her arms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s apartment was 203, on the second floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A very plain, old apartment building.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE> were here.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘ドア.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘表札アップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ノック響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I knocked on the door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no intercom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sound of knocking on the thin door echoed along the outside walkway.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ノック響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
But even after knocking twice, there was no response at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> turned the doorknob.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">? Are you there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The door opened easily, and <STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> stepped inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I followed her lead and slowly went in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The air was chilly, musty and stale.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were living in a place like this?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "escapescape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘思い出.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Just past the entrance there was a single room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Under a dim night-light, I could see two figures, one large and one small.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサーうつむき.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\美冬アラサー横顔.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> handed <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> to me and ran to the larger figure, and the two of them embraced under the night-light.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬アラサーバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I was worried about you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you really came...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, it's all right now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You don't have to worry about anything anymore..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a moving reunion, but this was no time to get sentimental.<PG>
Tomorrow, we might end up killing two children.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
When I looked at <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> in my arms, she was still breathing peacefully in her sleep.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>... I really can trust <STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE>, right?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬アラサーバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> came too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The tone of <STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>'s voice had clearly changed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, there was nowhere we could leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> was clearly hostile toward <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE>... it really will be okay, right?
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
